        "cnr1851",
        "cnr1907"
      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "Room for a little silliness",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "The formal portraits,",
            "accent": "and the laughter."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "I tend to fool around during a shoot. It is part of how I work with emotion: in a photograph, it can help to show a feeling a little more strongly than you would in everyday life. This is one still frame, after all, rather than a video showing every change of expression. I shoot in bursts of ten, so I can choose the moment when everything comes together.",
            "Getting this lovely couple from Japan to laugh and join in with my silliness was not easy, but we got there. Alongside the serious, beautiful wedding portraits, we caught a few wonderfully playful moments. Those will stay with all of us."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "dateTime": "2026-06-09",
  "review": {
    "author": "Takamasa",
    "authorDetail": "Japan · 10 June 2026",
    "rating": 5,
    "paragraphs": [
      "Amazing! Gregory, who took the photos, not only took wonderful pictures, but also kindly guided us around the area in a way that was easy to understand for us, who don't speak much Italian or English. He was cheerful the whole time, and he also introduced us to lesser-known landmarks and recommended restaurants in the area. The recommended restaurants were of course delicious, and the photos were excellent and delivered very quickly! I'd like to ask him to be my photographer and guide again when I go to Atrani! (We brought these costumes with us)"
    ],
    "original": {
      "lang": "ja",
      "paragraphs": [
        "素晴らしい！写真を撮ってくれたGregoryは素晴らしい写真を撮るだけではなく、イタリア語と英語の乏しい私たちに親切に分かりやすいように現地をガイドしてくれるだけでなく、始終朗らかで、おまけに現地のあまり知られていない名所やお勧めレストランも紹介してくれた。お勧めのレストランはもちろん美味しかったし、写真の仕上がりも素晴らしくとても早く届けてくれた！またアトラーニに行った時は彼に写真兼ガイドを頼みたい！ （この衣装は私達の持込です）"
      ]
    },
